# Everything in this repository is committed with LF endings, and is checked
# out with LF endings on every platform.
#
# This is not cosmetic: GitHub's Windows runners check out with
# core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites every .go file to CRLF, and `gofmt -l`
# then reports all of them as unformatted — which fails CI on its first step.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Images are binary; never touch them.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
